	PRINTFORMDL Her voice is quiet and gentle. She carries some kind of musical string instrument that looks like a long violin.
	PRINTFORMDW She slightly bows to you, and her hairpins shake and knock.
	PRINTFORMW 「I am %NAME:161%, Kirin Youkai. I work as a school nurse in the Human Village.」
	PRINTFORMDW You introduce yourself. %CALLNAME:161% moves with the modesty and maturity of a woman, despite her young look.
	PRINTFORML 「Nice to meet you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.　Welcome to Gensokyo, a fantastic land where any being can find peace, even humans.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I hope you will like it here.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Are you from the Outside world? I wonder how it changed over the years since I was there. I would be happy to hear your stories.」
	PRINTFORML 「If you are not feeling well, you can always visit Ering-sensei in the Bamboo Forest or me in the village. Don’t neglect your own health, even if it is something trivial.」
	PRINTFORMW 「And be careful on the roads at night. Most youkai are tame, but when the sun sets, some of them can be troublesome.」
